- `evaluation/`: contains the trees constructed on each of the barcodes: Cass-ILP, Startle-NNI, and the input files. This also contains scripts to create the cluster tree from the input lentibarcode cluster labels. Also contains the Bar12/bar12_indel_analysis folder with visualizations. 
- `postprocess/`: contains the LAML output tree for each barcode, after having evaluated all possible placements of cells with unknown lentibarcode cluster labels. Cluster trees were stitched together and reoptimized with Problin version 0.4b, except for bar10 which was run with problin v0.3. Runs on other barcodes did not finish during the original experiment. Files available here: /n/fs/ragr-research/projects/problin_experiments/Real_biodata/run_tlscl_all/output/Bar*/indep/EM_stitched_tree.* and /n/fs/ragr-research/projects/problin_experiments/Real_biodata/run_tlscl/process_bar10/runjobs/t3_r4_r0_jumpstart_parsub/EM_problin_v3_r5.*
- `visualization/`: contains the scripts and trees and pdfs, coloring barcodes 12 and 24 by lentibarcode cluster label.
- `tls_celltype/`: contains scripts and figures (as well as input trees) for TLS1 annotation with the cell type  metadata.


